  "remaining": [
    "Bundled Linux fixture only. Apple system SQLite lacked FILESTAT in the earlier public diagnostic test. Native macOS helper packaging, security-scoped grants, interoperation and real restart are unverified.",
    "WAL/SHM authority is pre-established. Initial absence, legitimate replacement, source history and session epochs need an enrollment protocol before production use.",
    "The upstream diagnostic JSON is version-specific. Production must bind to a private known backend and replace the per-check process mapping scan or validate an equally strict bounded alternative. No multi-connection performance measurement was taken.",
    "Checks identify the attachments carrying the transaction. They do not lock external name changes between the last comparison and a filesystem syscall."
  ]
